; Expect: BrushTexture: the texture [0-9]+ does not exist
; A debug build (-d) stops BrushTexture with a texture that was freed.
If GetEnv$("BLITZ_SUITE_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("BrushTexture: the texture 1 does not exist (release build, not checked).")
tex = CreateTexture(8, 8, 1)
brush = CreateBrush()
FreeTexture tex
BrushTexture brush, tex
Print "BrushTexture did not stop the program."
